# Multi-Agent Delegation Kit — Project-Level Configuration
# Path: <project_root>/.agents/delegation/config.env
# Priority: CLI flags > Project config (this file) > User config > Kit defaults
#
# Notes:
# - Safe KEY=VALUE format only (parsed without shell eval for repo safety).
# - Override only project-specific settings here (e.g. test command, budget, role overrides).

# --- Project test & execution defaults ---
# DELEGATE_DEFAULT_TEST_CMD is the command prefix a delegated Claude Code may run unattended
# (each prefix becomes a Bash(<prefix>:*) rule), so name the narrowest prefixes that cover this
# repo's checks, comma-separated:
#   pytest                       -> pytest tests/...
#   npm test,npm run             -> npm test and package scripts, but not npm install / npm exec
#   go test,go vet               -> go test ./..., go vet ./...
# Without it the kit default (python3) applies and a delegated coder in a Node/Go repo cannot run tests.
# DELEGATE_DEFAULT_TEST_CMD=pytest
# DELEGATE_DEFAULT_FALLBACK=fast            # comma-separated chain is allowed, e.g. fast,scout
# DELEGATE_DEFAULT_EFFORT=high
# DELEGATE_DEFAULT_MAX_BUDGET=1.00          # none or 0 removes the cap
# DELEGATE_DEFAULT_TIMEOUT=300s

# --- Optional project-specific role override ---
# DELEGATE_ROLE_CODER=claude:sonnet
# DELEGATE_DISABLED_HARNESSES=
# DELEGATE_DISABLED_PRESETS=
# DELEGATE_INHERIT_SUBAGENT=deny            # in this repo, refuse native `self` workers so coding goes to the coder channel
